+{"event":{"id":"fixture-turn-1","msg":{"item":{"content":[{"text":"This repo is for **ctx**, an Agentic Development Environment (ADE) that runs a local daemon to orchestrate coding agents across real workspaces. It’s a vendor‑neutral control plane for tasks/sessions/runs, ctx Packs (specs/skills/prompts), and multi‑agent workflows, with clients including a desktop app (Tauri web workbench), experimental desktop UI client, and mobile apps. The daemon owns state (workspaces, worktrees, tasks, sessions, runs, events) and exposes a local HTTP/WebSocket API; agents are integrated via provider adapters (Codex, Claude, Gemini, etc.), and large payloads stream via a data plane (artifacts, PTY, WebRTC).  \n\nIf you want, I can point you to the most relevant top‑level docs or walk through the main folders (`core/`, `harness-adapters/`, `external-harnesses/`, `docs/`, `supabase/`).","type":"Text"}],"id":"msg_095ba2c797e2c76d0169815d8af45c81a0ad58a406137aee54","type":"AgentMessage"},"thread_id":"019c2155-06cc-7472-9cd8-d1dc7d941ed5","turn_id":"fixture-turn-1","type":"item_completed"}},"i":861}
+{"event":{"id":"fixture-turn-1","msg":{"turn_id":"fixture-turn-1","last_agent_message":"This repo is for **ctx**, an Agentic Development Environment (ADE) that runs a local daemon to orchestrate coding agents across real workspaces. It’s a vendor‑neutral control plane for tasks/sessions/runs, ctx Packs (specs/skills/prompts), and multi‑agent workflows, with clients including a desktop app (Tauri web workbench), experimental desktop UI client, and mobile apps. The daemon owns state (workspaces, worktrees, tasks, sessions, runs, events) and exposes a local HTTP/WebSocket API; agents are integrated via provider adapters (Codex, Claude, Gemini, etc.), and large payloads stream via a data plane (artifacts, PTY, WebRTC).  \n\nIf you want, I can point you to the most relevant top‑level docs or walk through the main folders (`core/`, `harness-adapters/`, `external-harnesses/`, `docs/`, `supabase/`).","type":"task_complete"}},"i":865}
