+{"event":{"id":"fixture-turn-1","msg":{"item":{"content":[{"text":"This is the ctx monorepo: an Agentic Development Environment (ADE) that runs a local daemon to orchestrate coding agents over real workspaces, plus multiple clients and adapters. It’s built around a vendor‑neutral control plane for tasks, sessions, runs/turns, and structured context (ctx Packs), with support for different agent harnesses (Codex/Claude/Gemini/etc.) via adapters.\n\nKey areas you’ll see:\n- `core/` — main product code (daemon + clients + shared packages).\n- `harness-adapters/` and `external-harnesses/` — provider adapters and integrations.\n- `.ctx/ctx-pack/specs/` — the canonical specs that define domain model, APIs, UX invariants, etc.\n- `supabase/` — backend services for subscriptions/entitlements.\n- `docs/`, `partner-docs/`, `prior-art-analyses/` — supporting documentation and research.","type":"Text"}],"id":"msg_05253661ee4744cb0169815e025f44819e8ffbfa139ac805dd","type":"AgentMessage"},"thread_id":"019c2156-ce72-77e1-8698-0ba2c38c97b7","turn_id":"fixture-turn-1","type":"item_completed"}},"i":838}
+{"event":{"id":"fixture-turn-1","msg":{"turn_id":"fixture-turn-1","last_agent_message":"This is the ctx monorepo: an Agentic Development Environment (ADE) that runs a local daemon to orchestrate coding agents over real workspaces, plus multiple clients and adapters. It’s built around a vendor‑neutral control plane for tasks, sessions, runs/turns, and structured context (ctx Packs), with support for different agent harnesses (Codex/Claude/Gemini/etc.) via adapters.\n\nKey areas you’ll see:\n- `core/` — main product code (daemon + clients + shared packages).\n- `harness-adapters/` and `external-harnesses/` — provider adapters and integrations.\n- `.ctx/ctx-pack/specs/` — the canonical specs that define domain model, APIs, UX invariants, etc.\n- `supabase/` — backend services for subscriptions/entitlements.\n- `docs/`, `partner-docs/`, `prior-art-analyses/` — supporting documentation and research.","type":"task_complete"}},"i":842}
